config ZMKAY_USB_DFU_RESET
	bool "Reboot into the UF2 bootloader on a 1200bps touch of the DFU CDC port"
	help
	  Watches a USB CDC-ACM port for the host setting 1200 baud (the
	  Arduino/Adafruit "1200bps touch"), then reboots into the nRF52
	  UF2 bootloader (sys_reboot(RST_UF2)). Lets a host tool drive either
	  Corne half into DFU over USB without a physical double-tap reset.
	  Enabled by the usb-dfu-reset snippet.
